<main class="public-composition public-composition--help container">
  <section class="public-help-hero" aria-labelledby="help-title"><div><span class="eyebrow">Help</span><h1 id="help-title">Find answers and get support.</h1><p>Learn the basics, connect your sources and keep your Kurukoo relationship moving.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/chat">Open Web Chat</a></section>
  <section class="public-help-grid"><div class="public-help-principles"><article><svg class="k-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#chat"></use></svg><div><strong>Getting started</strong><span>Learn the basics and start your first conversation.</span></div><b>›</b></article><article><svg class="k-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#channels"></use></svg><div><strong>Connecting your sources</strong><span>Step-by-step guides for each provider.</span></div><b>›</b></article><article><svg class="k-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#safety"></use></svg><div><strong>Account &amp; privacy</strong><span>Manage your account, data and preferences.</span></div><b>›</b></article><article><svg class="k-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#package"></use></svg><div><strong>Billing &amp; plans</strong><span>Learn about seats, plans and billing boundaries.</span></div><b>›</b></article></div><aside class="public-help-contact"><span class="eyebrow">Still need help?</span><h2>Our team is here for you.</h2><p>Describe the issue in Web Chat or send a written enquiry when you need a human follow-up.</p><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/contact">Contact support</a></aside></section>
  <section class="public-help-detail" aria-labelledby="help-guides-title">
    <div class="public-help-detail__header"><span class="eyebrow">Help centre</span><h2 id="help-guides-title">Guides for the next useful step.</h2><p>Start in Web Chat, keep your request in context and use the relevant boundary when Kurukoo asks for it.</p></div>
    <div class="public-help-guides"><article class="public-detail-card"><span class="category-tag">Getting started</span><h3>How to use Kurukoo in Web Chat</h3><p>Describe what you need first. Sign in only when a protected action needs your identity.</p><ol><li>Open Web Chat from any page.</li><li>Describe the request in your own words.</li><li>Use the sign-in step when Kurukoo needs to preserve or protect the request.</li></ol></article><article class="public-detail-card"><span class="category-tag">Provider participation</span><h3>Adding your skills as a provider</h3><p>Describe the capability you can offer. Participation, matching and any payment terms require separate confirmation.</p><ul><li>Tell Kurukoo what you can do.</li><li>Review the capability and evidence boundaries.</li><li>Confirm availability only when it is accurate.</li></ul></article></div>
  </section>
  <section class="public-help-questions" aria-labelledby="common-questions-title"><div><span class="eyebrow">Common questions</span><h2 id="common-questions-title">Answers without overpromising.</h2><div class="public-question-list"><details><summary>Can I use another channel?</summary><p>Web Chat is the available channel in this deployment. Messaging, USSD and SMS are shown only when their adapters are connected.</p></details><details><summary>What if no one is available right now?</summary><p>Kurukoo can record a deferred request when matching cannot continue immediately. Any notification depends on a configured delivery channel.</p></details><details><summary>Can I share photos or documents for context?</summary><p>You can attach supported content in Web Chat. A provider may use that context when preparing a quote, subject to the relevant evidence and authorization boundaries.</p></details><details><summary>Can I get reminders for important things?</summary><p>Kurukoo can preserve reminder intent and show the current readiness state. Delivery is not represented as active unless the required notification capability is configured.</p></details></div></div><aside class="public-detail-card public-help-questions__aside"><h3>Need a human follow-up?</h3><p>Use Web Chat to describe the issue or send a written enquiry through the contact page.</p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/chat">Open Web Chat</a><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/contact">Contact guidance</a></aside></section>
</main>
<%- include('_partials/footer') %>
